---
const stats = [
  { value: "17", label: "years on the road" },
  { value: "4,800+", label: "travellers hosted" },
  { value: "12", label: "seats max per group" },
];
---

<section id="top" class="relative flex min-h-svh flex-col overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      src="/images/twante-kiln.jpg"
      alt=""
      width="640"
      height="427"
      fetchpriority="high"
      class="animate-hero-zoom size-full object-cover"
    />
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-lacquer via-lacquer/60 to-lacquer/20"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-2/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-lacquer via-lacquer/40 to-transparent">
    </div>
  </div>

  <p
    class="absolute top-1/2 right-6 hidden -translate-y-1/2 font-myanmar text-sm tracking-[0.5em] text-gold/50 [writing-mode:vertical-rl] lg:block"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    ရွှေတိုင်း ရွှေမြို့
  </p>

  <div
    class="relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-1 flex-col justify-end px-5 pt-32 pb-12 sm:px-8"
  >
    <p
      data-reveal
      class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.24em] text-gold uppercase"
    >
      <span class="h-px w-10 bg-gold"></span>
      Boutique journeys through Myanmar — since 2009
    </p>

    <h1
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
      class="mt-6 max-w-4xl font-display text-[clamp(2.75rem,8vw,6.5rem)] leading-[1.02] tracking-wide text-bone text-balance"
    >
      The Golden Land,
      <span class="block text-gold">unhurried.</span>
    </h1>

    <p
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay: 180ms"
      class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-bone/80"
    >
      We are a family-run team in Yangon planning private and small-group
      journeys across Myanmar — from the temple plains of Bagan to the stilt
      villages of Inle Lake — led by guides who grew up on these very roads.
    </p>

    <div data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 260ms" class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
      <a
        href="#journeys"
        class="border border-gold bg-gold px-7 py-4 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.16em] text-lacquer uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-gold-soft hover:border-gold-soft"
      >
        Browse our journeys
      </a>
      <a
        href="#story"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-bone/30 px-7 py-4 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.16em] text-bone uppercase transition-colors hover:border-gold hover:text-gold"
      >
        Meet the family
        <span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <dl
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay: 340ms"
      class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 border-t border-gold/25 pt-6 sm:grid-cols-5"
    >
      {
        stats.map((stat) => (
          <div>
            <dt class="sr-only">{stat.label}</dt>
            <dd class="tnum font-display text-3xl text-bone">{stat.value}</dd>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-gold/80 uppercase">
              {stat.label}
            </dd>
          </div>
        ))
      }
      <div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1 sm:text-right">
        <dd class="font-mono text-[10px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.18em] text-bone/60 uppercase">
          Next departure<br />
          <span class="text-gold">12 Oct — 3 seats left</span>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-2 hidden sm:col-span-1 sm:block sm:text-right">
        <dd class="font-mono text-[10px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.18em] text-bone/50 uppercase">
          Twante kiln, fired at 1,000&nbsp;°C<br />
          N&nbsp;16°43′ E&nbsp;95°34′
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div
    data-reveal
    style="--reveal-delay: 420ms"
    class="absolute top-24 right-8 hidden size-28 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-lacquer/50 backdrop-blur-sm md:grid"
  >
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="animate-spin-slow absolute size-full" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <path
          id="stamp-circle"
          d="M50,50 m-36,0 a36,36 0 1,1 72,0 a36,36 0 1,1 -72,0"></path>
      </defs>
      <text class="fill-gold font-mono text-[9.5px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase">
        <textPath href="#stamp-circle">
          local guides · small groups · est. 2009 ·
        </textPath>
      </text>
    </svg>
    <span class="text-xl text-gold" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
    <span class="sr-only">Local guides, small groups, established 2009</span>
  </div>
</section>
